  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nGiven equation: **8 × (7 + 5 − 3) + (46 ÷ 23) × 6 − 69 = 44**\n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **6 and 7**\n\n→ 8 × **(6 + 5 − 3)** + **(46 ÷ 23)** × 7 − 69 = 44\n\n→ **8 × 8** + **2 × 7** − 69 = 44\n\n→ **64 + 14** − 69 = 44\n\n→ 78 − 69 = 44\n\n→ 9 ≠ 44\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **3 and 5**\n\n→ 8 × **(7 + 3 − 5)** + **(46 ÷ 23)** × 6 − 69 = 44\n\n→ **8 × 5** + **2 × 6** − 69 = 44\n\n→ **40 + 12** − 69 = 44\n\n→ 52 − 69 = 44\n\n→ -17 ≠ 44\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) **8 and 6**\n\n→ 6 × **(7 + 5 − 3)** + **(46 ÷ 23)** × 8 − 69 = 44\n\n→ **6 × 8** + **2 × 8** − 69 = 44\n\n→ 14 + 16 − 69 = 44\n\n→ 30 − 69 = 44\n\n→ -39 ≠ 44\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) **46 and 69**\n\n→ 8 × **(7 + 5 − 3)** + **(69 ÷ 23)** × 6 − 46 = 44\n\n→ **8 × 9** + **3 × 6** − 46 = 44\n\n→ **72 + 18** − 46 = 44\n\n→ 90 − 46 = 44\n\n→ 44 = 44\n\n→ **LHS = RHS ⇒ Satisfies the equation.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****46 and 69\"**.",
